                Pexp_constant PConst_string(" A sequence [xs] of type ['a t] is a delayed list of elements of\n    type ['a]. Such a sequence is queried by performing a function\n    application [xs()]. This function application returns a node,\n    allowing the caller to determine whether the sequence is empty\n    or nonempty, and in the latter case, to obtain its head and tail. ",(stdlib/seq.mli[91,4815+0]..[95,5083+72]),None)
