              Pexp_constant PConst_string(" [of_dispenser it] is the sequence of the elements produced by the\n    dispenser [it]. It is an ephemeral sequence: it can be consumed at most\n    once. If a persistent sequence is needed, use\n    [memoize (of_dispenser it)].\n\n    @since 4.14 ",(stdlib/seq.mli[740,26785+0]..[745,27015+18]),None)
